    "ms_lines": {
      "type": "ms-cards",
      "name": "The three lines",
      "settings": {
        "tone": "ivory",
        "head_rule": false,
        "eyebrow": "The three lines",
        "heading": "Specified by the room it is going into.",
        "heading_size": "h2",
        "intro": "<p>Three lines, and the difference between them is construction rather than trim. Each is made to order, so dimensions, comfort level and fabric are specification decisions on every one.</p>",
        "head_layout": "stacked",
        "head_link_label": "",
        "head_link": "",
        "columns": "3",
        "image_ratio": "portrait",
        "title_size": "h3",
        "card_rule": true,
        "card_align": "left",
        "button_label": "Request the Hospitality Catalogue",
        "button_link": "/pages/contact",
        "button_panel": true,
        "padding_top": 120,
        "padding_bottom": 120
      },
      "blocks": {
        "card_1": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "bed",
            "numeral": "I",
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "Amalfi",
            "tagline": "For rooms at scale",
            "text": "<p>The line written for key counts. Natural fibres and authentic artisan construction, specified once and repeated faithfully across a floor, with maintenance protocols a housekeeping team can actually follow.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "link": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "open_panel": false
          }
        },
        "card_2": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "star",
            "numeral": "II",
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "Silver Dream",
            "tagline": "For suites",
            "text": "<p>A spring architecture under Loro Piana Interiors upholstery, where the room is sold on how it feels rather than how it photographs. Comfort levels chosen per suite type.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "link": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "open_panel": false
          }
        },
        "card_3": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "gem",
            "numeral": "III",
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "Rapallo",
            "tagline": "For signature suites and residences",
            "text": "<p>The fullest construction we place in contract: layered spring cores, the precious fibres, and dimensions cut to the room rather than the room cut to a mattress.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "link": "",
            "link_label": "",
            "open_panel": false
          }
        }
      },
